WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.795 line:85%
I never drove anywhere. I just listened to Mars!

2
00:00:04.885 --> 00:00:07.027 line:85%
I'm InSight, a lander.

3
00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:13.267 line:85%
I launched in 2018 and set a super-sensitive seismometer on the ground.

4
00:00:13.357 --> 00:00:16.329 line:85%
Every day, I felt for tiny shakes.

5
00:00:16.419 --> 00:00:22.147 line:85%
And Mars rumbled: I detected 1,319 marsquakes!

6
00:00:22.237 --> 00:00:27.878 line:85%
Because of that, scientists could study Mars' crust, mantle and core.

7
00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:36.035 line:85%
Slowly, dust covered my solar panels, and my power faded until my mission ended in 2022.

8
00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:38.999 line:85%
What do you think is deep inside Mars?
